---
// Component: SystemComparison.astro
---
<!-- 6. DECISION GUIDE (WIREFRAME BLOCK 6 - 3 COMPARISON CARDS) -->
  <section id="decision-guide" class="py-20 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-black text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-50 dark:bg-cyan-950/50 border border-cyan-200 dark:border-cyan-800/50">
          Buyer's Technical Advice
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight">
          Which CCTV System Suits Your Property?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
          An honest breakdown of technologies, trade-offs, and practical considerations for Carindale property owners.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Guide 1: Wired PoE -->
        <div class="glass-box p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-blue-500 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-xs font-black mb-4">
              GOLD STANDARD
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Wired PoE</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Continuous local recording and a stable data connection for permanent installations. Powered over a single Cat6 ethernet cable directly from the central NVR.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pt-4 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                <strong class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓ 24/7 Continuous:</strong>
                <span> Never misses a second of incident footage.</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓ Zero Wi-Fi Jams:</strong>
                <span> Immune to wireless signal jamming and interference.</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓ $0 Subscriptions:</strong>
                <span> All video stored locally on your hard drive with zero cloud bills.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">
            <strong class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Best For:</strong> Detached houses, townhouses, retail shops &amp; commercial offices.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Guide 2: Wi-Fi or Battery -->
        <div class="glass-box p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/15 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 text-xs font-black mb-4">
              FLEXIBLE OPTION
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Wi-Fi or Battery</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Useful where cabling is impractical, with power, signal and subscription trade-offs explained upfront before purchase.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pt-4 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                <strong class="text-cyan-500 font-bold">• Rental Friendly:</strong>
                <span> Easy to remove and take with you when moving properties.</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-amber-500 font-bold">⚠ Battery Charging:</strong>
                <span> Requires periodic ladder access to recharge every 2–3 months.</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-amber-500 font-bold">⚠ Motion Lag:</strong>
                <span> Camera only starts recording 1–2 seconds after wake-up sensor trips.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">
            <strong class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Best For:</strong> Short-term rental homes, solid double-brick units &amp; temporary job sites.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Guide 3: Camera Features -->
        <div class="glass-box p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-black mb-4">
              OPTICS &amp; INTELLIGENCE
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Camera Features</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Resolution, lens angle, IR or full-colour night vision, detection, deterrence and audio settings customized for your layout.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pt-4 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                <strong class="text-amber-500 font-bold">👁️ 4K vs 4MP:</strong>
                <span> 4K provides digital zoom to read number plates and facial features.</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-amber-500 font-bold">🌈 ColorVu Night:</strong>
                <span> F1.0 super-aperture captures vivid clothing color in pitch black.</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-amber-500 font-bold">🧠 AcuSense AI:</strong>
                <span> Smart target filter categorizes humans and vehicles, ignoring trees.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">
            <strong class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Best For:</strong> Property owners seeking police-grade evidentiary detail.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
